From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 02:40:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Share libzstd with the Venus Vulkan HAL

The Kernarium Vulkan HAL is Mesa Venus built from this project own pinned
guest Mesa source, which lives in external/mesa3d-venus. Mesa util links the
same zstd shader-cache dependency the GLES port already uses, so grant that
tree the same visibility the AOSP Mesa port has.
---
 Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 51f5d112f94d45c589827fe4921708bbe0b99799..793a0c9eb30d210278d762f6c44c1ad1bb503031 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -78,6 +78,7 @@ cc_library {
         "//external/libbpf:__subpackages__",
         "//external/mesa3d:__subpackages__",
         "//external/rsync:__subpackages__",
+        "//external/mesa3d-venus:__subpackages__",
         "//external/squashfs-tools/squashfs-tools:__subpackages__",
         "//external/stg:__subpackages__",
         "//frameworks/libs/binary_translation/tools:__subpackages__",
